OL,3,ALost on Mount Fuji off-season? You'll
OL,4,Ahave to pay for your rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom next year, people who attempt to
OL,7,Fclimb Mount Fuji during off-peak
OL,8,Fseasons and then require rescue by
OL,9,Fhelicopter will have to pay for the
OL,10,Fservice, authorities governing the
OL,11,Fnorthern part of the peak say.
OL,13,FThe fee is among a series of measures
OL,14,FJapan's Yamanashi prefecture is
OL,15,Fintroducing to deter reckless and
OL,16,Fpoorly prepared climbers.
OL,18,FA similar fee of 8,000 yen ($51; #38)
OL,19,Fper five minutes is already in place in
OL,20,Fnearby Saitama prefecture for other
OL,21,Fmountainous areas and will be used as a
OL,22,Freference.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
