OL,3,ALost on Mount Fuji off-season? You'll
OL,4,Ahave to pay for your rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FYamanashi authorities will also require
OL,7,Fthose looking to scale Fuji during the
OL,8,Foff-season, which runs from early
OL,9,FSeptember to July the following year,
OL,10,Fto submit detailed climbing plans.
